    "productDescriptionProps": {
      "paragraphs": [
        "Easy to understand and fold out – ÄLVDALEN sofa quickly transforms into a comfortable double bed for you or your overnight friends. Or the best place to take a nice nap.",
        "Perfect for smaller spaces with its neat design and the practical and easily accessible storage space under the seat.",
        "Plenty of seating space for friends and family. And when the sofa is folded out, you get a large lounge area to hang out on.",
        "This cover is made from Knisa fabric in polyester, which is dope-dyed. It’s a durable material which has a soft feel.",
        "The design is versatile and fits in many different environments. The clean-lined look makes it easy to add a personal touch with cushions and throws.",
        "The seat is made with foam and zigzag springs that provide firm and supportive comfort – both when you sit and lie down.",
        "10-year limited warranty. Read about the terms in the limited warranty brochure."
      ],
